# Build output. Never committed here — see README.md § The rules.
#
# A committed .bbl is the one that actually broke something: bibtex8 rebuilds it
# on every compile, so the committed copy only goes stale, and biblatex rejects
# a .bbl written by a different version outright. Every citation then comes out
# undefined, and the app reports "this bibliography was built by a different
# biblatex" instead of the problem the document really has.
#
# The gate cannot produce any of this — it compiles in the engine's in-memory
# VFS. A system-TeX run beside the sources can, which is why this file exists.
*.aux
*.bbl
*.bcf
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.idx
*.ilg
*.ind
*.lof
*.log
*.lot
*.out
*.pdf
*.run.xml
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
